BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:reviewer-orientation@2027-03-02@internet-security-snapshot
DTSTAMP:20261024T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270302
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270315
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:[Reviewer] Snapshot: Getting started - read the overview\, plan and
  statistical review
DESCRIPTION:Responsible: Reviewer (external reviewer)\n\nAbout 3-4 hours in
 cluding the call. docs/HOW_IT_WORKS.md (the overview)\, the registered pla
 n (OSF DOI 10.17605/OSF.IO/3XT82\, and prereg/ in the repository)\, docs/S
 TATISTICAL_REVIEW_2026-10-24.md. Can start in February if you confirm earl
 y.\n\nSource: docs/schedule/schedule.yaml
CATEGORIES:External reviewer
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:reviewer-practice@2027-03-02@internet-security-snapshot
DTSTAMP:20261024T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270302
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270315
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:[Reviewer] Snapshot: Optional - practice round as second coder (pil
 ot quarter)
DESCRIPTION:Responsible: Reviewer (external reviewer)\n\nAbout 45 minutes\,
  not scored. 20 items from the Q4 2026 pilot with Paul's answers removed: 
 mostly fix dates (open the vendor's advisory\, record when the fix was rel
 eased).\n\nSource: docs/schedule/schedule.yaml
CATEGORIES:External reviewer
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:reviewer-practice-send@2027-03-02@internet-security-snapshot
DTSTAMP:20261024T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270302
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270303
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:[Claude] Snapshot: Send the reviewer the practice second-coder shee
 t (pilot quarter)
DESCRIPTION:Responsible: Claude (claude)\n\npython -m snapshot.agreement sa
 mple --batch 2026Q4\; send the sheet (not the weights file) and the writte
 n rules. Unscored practice\; score it only to discuss on the onboarding ca
 ll.\n\nSource: docs/schedule/schedule.yaml
CATEGORIES:Claude
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
