DTSTAMP:20261024T000000Z
DTSTART:20270304T150000Z
DTEND:20270304T160000Z
SUMMARY:[Paul] Snapshot: Onboarding call with the external reviewer
DESCRIPTION:Responsible: Paul (author)\n\nWalk through the repository\, the
  hand-check rules and the second-coder sheet\; answer questions\; go over 
 the practice round if done. Move the time to suit the reviewer.\n\nSource:
  docs/schedule/schedule.yaml
CATEGORIES:Author
END:VEVENT
